id": "18136634725630375", "text": "Would be cool if you could take a foto of a technical drawing/sketch with dimensions and it would model that. As it is, even though it\u2019s cool, I\u2019d probably still prefer a regular cad Programm, after all especially when it comes to complex geometry simply sketching is probably still faster and you have more controll", "timestamp": 1791745327, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ojito.obj", "author_id": "16393780627", "id": "17952458562276977", "text": "\ud83d\ude02", "timestamp": 1791729570, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "fensieren", "author_id": "1109584081", "id": "18038847956835549", "text": "Using an ai to execute instructions is like using a wrench to open a bottle", "timestamp": 1791653228, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "colingoss_", "author_id": "32518364124", "id": "18126324835862284", "text": "Does it do fusion 360", "timestamp": 1791612777, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_m0rd3cvil_", "author_id": "48500540965", "id": "18165305776492029", "text": "So it's OpensCAD but understandable \ud83d\udc4c", "timestamp": 1791542509, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "divyeruhela", "author_id": "1372185294", "id": "17909303139519664", "text": "That's just openscad", "timestamp": 1791490682, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "monneratrj", "author_id": "22420663392", "id": "17909807247548570", "text": "You can create a MCP using that and hand it to Claude or ChatGPT", "timestamp": 1791334630, "like_count": 1}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeFJd9AHPVS/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeFJd9AHPVS/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeFJd9AHPVS", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/837888072_4735629033389107_8419566890969307306_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=NDAwMDY0NTQ4NDc3MjEyODA4MjE4MTQwODg3OTg0NTQzODMw.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=5